{"_v":1,"id":"chicago-1996","bd":{"positive":9,"mixed":3,"negative":0},"rv":[{"cn":"Greg Evans","o":"Variety","s":91,"b":"Rave","t":1,"u":"http://www.variety.com/review/VE1117432920.html?categoryid=33&cs=1&query=chicago+revival+1996","d":"1996-11-23","q":"If the Kander & Ebb style can be described in one word, it's showstopper."},{"cn":"Ben Brantley","o":"The New York Times","s":88,"b":"Rave","t":1,"u":"http://www.nytimes.com/1996/11/15/theater/a-lively-legacy-a-come-hither-air.html","d":"1996-11-15","q":"It's flesh and blood shaped by discipline and artistry into a parade of vital, pulsing talent."},{"cn":"Mark Kennedy","o":"Associated Press","s":82,"b":"Positive","t":1,"u":"/people/Mark-Kennedy/","q":"This is fresh, energetic and unlike anything else on Broadway."},{"cn":"Elisabeth Vincentelli","o":"New York Post","s":68,"b":"Mixed","t":1,"u":"https://www.nypost.com/p/entertainment/theater/lost_in_translation_hilariously_DY1bkqQVDFyASHDbAyQEyH","q":"Under Leigh Silverman's direction, the cast craftily exploits every comic opportunity, and smoothly inhabits David Korins' clever, ever-moving set"},{"cn":"Andrzej Lukowski","o":"Time Out New York","s":60,"b":"Mixed","t":1,"u":"https://www.timeout.com/london/theatre/chicago-review"},{"cn":"Howard Kissel","o":"New York Daily News","s":90,"b":"Rave","t":2,"u":"https://www.nydailynews.com/2015/11/13/chicago-revival-is-a-class-act-1996-review/","d":"1996-11-14","q":"Bebe Neuwirth is sensational as Velma, a sister convict Roxie shoves out of the spotlight."},{"cn":"Elyse Sommer","o":"CurtainUp","s":89,"b":"Rave","t":2,"u":"http://www.curtainup.com/chicago.html","d":"1996-11-20","q":"It remains a heartening experience, a life-affirming dedication to the magic and art of theatre, and something that absolutely should not be missed."},{"cn":"Richard Zoglin","o":"Time","s":87,"b":"Rave","t":2,"u":"https://www.time.com/time/magazine/article/0,9171,985604,00.html","d":"2014-04-22","q":"What seemed cynical in 1975 is now au courant